<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/memberships-style.css">
    <title>Document</title>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main class="main-section temp-border">
        <h3>Memberships</h3>
        <section class="memberships-section temp-border">
            <div class="membership-column-div temp-border">
                <img src="../assets/Silver.svg" alt="">
                <form>
                    <script src="https://checkout.razorpay.com/v1/payment-button.js" data-payment_button_id="pl_QEWBXlMKNEeD46" async>
                    </script>
                </form>
            </div>
            <div class="membership-column-div temp-border">
                <img src="../assets/Gold.svg" alt="">
                <form>
                    <script src="https://checkout.razorpay.com/v1/payment-button.js" data-payment_button_id="pl_QEWW7MQGJ16Dwt" async>
                    </script>
                </form>
                <!-- <button class="gold-btn">Select</button> -->
            </div>
            <div class="membership-column-div temp-border">
                <img src="../assets/Platinum.svg" alt="">
                <form>
                    <script src="https://checkout.razorpay.com/v1/payment-button.js" data-payment_button_id="pl_QEWZPU8yz0z4G2" async>
                    </script>
                </form>
                <!-- <button class="platinum-btn">Select</button> -->
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <div class="subscription-info">
        <p> Whenever the car gets sold after 4-5 years, the proceeds  gets shared equally among the share holders</p>
        <br>
        <p>One can take more than one share among the 10-12  members or take share in different set of cars to enjoy  more than one car</p>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer.ejs') %>

    <script src="../js/menu-btn-script.js"></script>
    <script src="../js/membership-btn-script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>